"<div class=\"politik-karte breit2\"><span class=\"label\">L.A.C.I.-Verbünde · links der innere Kreis, rechts euer Dorf</span>\n      {0}\n      <p class=\"note\">Ab 50 hören die Maschinen auf euch, ab −50 auf den inneren Kreis. Siege, Funkcodes und Entscheidungen verschieben die Balken.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"politik-karte\"><span class=\"label\">Die Bestehenden</span>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Zorn des inneren Kreises</b><span class=\"{1}\">{2} / 100</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Bruder Anselm</b><span>{3}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Verschmutzung</b><span class=\"{4}\">{5} / 100</span></div>\n      {6}</div>\n    {7}\n    {8}":"<div class=\"politik-karte breit2\"><span class=\"label\">L.A.C.I. clusters · inner circle on the left, your village on the right</span>\n      {0}\n      <p class=\"note\">From 50 on the machines listen to you, from −50 to the inner circle. Victories, radio codes and decisions move the bars.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"politik-karte\"><span class=\"label\">The Abiding</span>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Wrath of the inner circle</b><span class=\"{1}\">{2} / 100</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Brother Anselm</b><span>{3}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Pollution</b><span class=\"{4}\">{5} / 100</span></div>\n      {6}</div>\n    {7}\n    {8}",
"<div class=\"politik-karte breit2\"><span class=\"label\">L.A.C.I.-Verbünde · links gegen die Maschinen, rechts mit ihnen</span>\n      {0}\n      <p class=\"note\">Stufen: Kontakt 25, Vertrauen 50, Bund 80. Gegen die Maschinen: Störung −25, Lahmgelegt −50, Zerschlagen −80. Der innere Kreis zehrt am Vertrauen.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"politik-karte\"><span class=\"label\">Die Bestehenden</span>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Zorn des inneren Kreises</b><span class=\"{1}\">{2} / 100</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Bruder Anselm</b><span>{3}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Verschmutzung</b><span class=\"{4}\">{5} / 100</span></div>\n      {6}</div>\n    {7}\n    {8}":"<div class=\"politik-karte breit2\"><span class=\"label\">L.A.C.I. clusters · against the machines on the left, with them on the right</span>\n      {0}\n      <p class=\"note\">Levels: Contact 25, Trust 50, Alliance 80. Against the machines: Disruption −25, Crippled −50, Smashed −80. The inner circle wears down trust.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"politik-karte\"><span class=\"label\">The Abiding</span>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Wrath of the inner circle</b><span class=\"{1}\">{2} / 100</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Brother Anselm</b><span>{3}</span></div>\n      <div class=\"nachbar\"><b>Pollution</b><span class=\"{4}\">{5} / 100</span></div>\n      {6}</div>\n    {7}\n    {8}",
