"Grüß Gott beinand! Grimbart hoaß i, Schmied bin i. Und des, wos ihr bis jetzt Schmiede gnennt habts, des war a Witz. A guada Witz, aber a Witz.":"Well, hullo there, all o' ye! Grimbart's the name, smithin's the game. An' that thing ye've been callin' a smithy till now, that were a joke. A good joke, mind, but a joke.",
